      "date_verified": true,
      "discovered_at": "2026-07-25T08:23:38.442362Z",
      "category": "fan",
      "summary": "Q: How on top of the new parts did you get with only one session? \"I didn't have them today. I think on Landos car, they've been working as expected which is good. I don't think they've completely changed the car which obviously we weren't expecting but, would've been nice. We'll see what it's like on my car tomorrow and hopefully we can have a successful day!\"",
      "summary_zh": "问:在新的部分上,你怎么会只有一次会话? \"我今天没有 我想在兰多斯车上 他们一直按预期工作 这很好 我觉得他们并没有完全改变那辆车 显然,我们没有预料到 但是,这将是很好的。 我们明天会看看我的车里是什么样子 希望我们能有一个成功的一天!\"",
